  "what_this_bounds": "Each arm contributes its replicates, and the only scale a difference is stated in is the spread between replicates of the same arm. With this many replicates that spread is itself poorly determined, so a gap of a few replicate standard deviations is a quantity to look at and not a result. Nothing here tests folding, binding or transport, and the humanised surrogate still requires experimental validation of all three before use in pharmacological screening."
